    "title": "Galveston Chamber to Host Legislative Luncheon in October - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Reports ,\n7 hours ago GALVESTON — The Galveston Regional Chamber of Commerce will hold its Biennial Legislative Luncheon on Thursday, Oct. 16, at the San Luis Resort, Spa & Conference Center. The event will feature Senator Mayes Middleton, Representative Dr. Greg Bonnen, and Representative Terri Leo-Wilson, who are expected to share updates on the 89th Legislative Session and what recent state decisions mean for the Galveston area. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
